flowchart TD
    EquipPage[/equipamentos/[id]/] --> Cart[Add to cart]
    Cart --> Orcamento[/orcamento/]
    Orcamento --> Api[POST /api/quotes]
    Api --> Validate[Validate + pricing]
    Validate --> Db[(PostgreSQL)]
    Api --> Email[Send confirmation email]
    Api --> Boleto{CPF/CNPJ and total > 0?}
    Boleto -->|yes| Asaas[Asaas boleto]
    Boleto -->|no| Skip[Skip boleto generation]
    Db --> Admin[/admin/orcamentos/]
